{"4995870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "QBLOX", "steam_appid": 4995870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5102740], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QBLOX — Shift the Axis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QBLOX reimagines the classic block‑stacking formula with a modern, fast-paced 3D twist. You play between two opposing walls, shifting the axis to redirect falling blocks and create perfect line breaks. Every switch triggers a smooth 180° camera rotation, forming a rhythmic visual flow that blends precision, speed, and spatial awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the angle, manage the space, and chain multiple line clears to trigger dynamic visual feedback. The dual‑wall system transforms each decision into a strategic moment, pushing you to think ahead while reacting instantly. Clean UI, minimalist effects, and aggressive cinematic motion define the game’s signature style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QBLOX delivers a fresh, modern puzzle experience built on fluid controls, sharp timing, and a unique axis‑shifting mechanic that challenges your reflexes and your sense of space.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>QBLOX — Shift the Axis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QBLOX reimagines the classic block‑stacking formula with a modern, fast-paced 3D twist. You play between two opposing walls, shifting the axis to redirect falling blocks and create perfect line breaks. Every switch triggers a smooth 180° camera rotation, forming a rhythmic visual flow that blends precision, speed, and spatial awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control the angle, manage the space, and chain multiple line clears to trigger dynamic visual feedback. The dual‑wall system transforms each decision into a strategic moment, pushing you to think ahead while reacting instantly. Clean UI, minimalist effects, and aggressive cinematic motion define the ga